Cell["\<\
For background, see the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]CoupledSqrWellV4.nb and *V5.nb\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] files.  Here, I will set up a streamlined version of \
the code. \
\>", "Text",
